# trip_mgmt.func

> Module: trip_mgmt (Sefer Yönetimi) | Category: CRM

## Purpose
Trip (sefer) management — the core operational module for logistics companies. Plan, execute, and track cargo transport trips with route info, fees, payment status, and documentary support (irsaliye).

## Problems It Solves
- Every trucking company's primary operation is managing trips
- Trip lifecycle: planned → in progress → completed → invoiced
- Route tracking: origin → destination with cities
- Revenue tracking per trip (fee, payment status)
- Quick-create related entities: truck, driver, customer from trip form
- Auto-generate invoice on trip completion
- İrsaliye (waybill) number tracking for legal compliance

## Technical Database Structure
**Table:** `trips`
| Column | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| id | SERIAL PK | Unique identifier |
| tenant_id | INTEGER FK | Tenant isolation |
| kamyon_id | INTEGER FK | Truck |
| sofor_id | INTEGER FK | Driver (FK to employees) |
| musteri_id | INTEGER FK | Customer |
| cikis_yeri | VARCHAR(200) | Origin |
| varis_yeri | VARCHAR(200) | Destination |
| cikis_tarihi | DATE | Departure date |
| varis_tarihi | DATE | Arrival date |
| ucret | DECIMAL(12,2) | Fee |
| odeme_durumu | odeme_durumu_enum | Payment status |
| durum | trip_durum_enum | Trip status |
| irsaliye_no | VARCHAR(50) | Waybill number |
| yuk_aciklamasi | TEXT | Cargo description |
| created_at, updated_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | Timestamps |

**Enums:**
- `trip_durum_enum`: PLANLANDI, DEVAM_EDIYOR, TAMAMLANDI, IPTAL_EDILDI
- `odeme_durumu_enum`: BEKLIYOR, KISMEN_ODENDI, ODENDI

## User Interface
**TripsPage.tsx** — `/dashboard/trips`
- DataGrid table: Çıkış → Varış, Müşteri, Kamyon, Şoför, Tarih, Ücret, Durum, Ödeme
- Status badges: blue (planned), orange (in progress), green (completed)
- Add modal with: truck selector, driver selector, customer selector, origin/destination, dates, fee
- Quick-create buttons: add truck/driver/customer inline
- Auto-invoice: checkbox to generate invoice on completion
- Filters: by status, truck, date range
- Export to CSV/Excel/PDF

## API Endpoints
| Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|--------|------|:---:|-------------|
| GET | `/api/tenant/trips/` | Tenant JWT | List trips |
| POST | `/api/tenant/trips/` | Tenant JWT | Create trip |
| PUT | `/api/tenant/trips/{id}` | Tenant JWT | Update trip (status change) |
| DELETE | `/api/tenant/trips/{id}` | Tenant JWT | Remove trip |

